{
  "id": "38",
  "title": "女命总断歌",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“女命总断歌”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "择妇须沉静，细说与君听。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-dc2eb4218f343644478d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "夫主要强宫，身主要强甚。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-c4fe1c6bc294f4e48249-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官星若不合，夫主无所依。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-aaf2979e4e506c8837cb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "合绝莫合贵，此法少人推。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-1290085cf0e433b5e48d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "专以日为年，此法少人传。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-c26ce05c06389786042c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "带禄入生旺，产死教人谤。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-ff8f7004003f12fe5488-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "驛马带贵人，终久落风尘。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-01ba8cef052f76b27a73-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有辰休见戌，有戌休见辰；辰戌若相见，多是淫贱人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-e9e7e12172a7ffa8ee42-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有杀不怕合，无杀却怕合；合神若是多，非妓亦謳歌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-86adb08438ac64bf112e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贵人一座正，两三作宠定。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-6c23e979facbce703a6b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃带伤官，驳杂事多端。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-d0e0d2b43bc29aaf882d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "满盘多是印，损子必须定。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-e52d02f6989e46109d4e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "二德坐正财，富贵自然来。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-b489f91a613636f6dff1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "四柱俱休囚，封赠福禄寿。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-28aa293b4665334c1975-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金水若相逢，必招美丽容。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-eb42ee2f90c9442ac32f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "寅申巳亥全，孤淫口便便。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-c25c996b4f7ab4174ae6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "子午逢卯酉，定是随人走。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-e709655d0c40ee7f0f9a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辰戌逢丑未，妇道之大忌。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-7710fdee8df0dbda7dee-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "两贵一位杀，权家富贵说。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-56a8a2205acc3c7fb6d8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官若藏库，冲破岂不富。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-a7edffa8a71942099d2d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "天干一字连，孤破祸绵绵。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-a6b0367b468b8aa6f9ad-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "地字连一字，两度成婚事。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "38-631e196098344e54cf5c-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
